# every page, a minute of the first piece, dub hold
wav pages.wav
wait 20000
shot main.png
tap ENV
wait 300
shot chord.png
tap ARP
wait 300
shot texture.png
tap LFO
wait 300
shot bass.png
tap SEQ
wait 300
shot drums.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot space.png
tap GLO
wait 300
shot setup.png
tap HOME
tap REC
wait 4000
shot hold.png
tap REC
press ENV
wait 1200
shot help.png
release ENV
wait 2000
wavstop
